														<r3d:remarks>IDC and TCIA (https://www.re3data.org/repository/r3d100011559) are partners in providing FAIR data for cancer imaging researchers. The mission of IDC is to support efficient access and use of the cancer imaging data, after it was de-identified and released. IDC-curated datasets are assigned a DOI by Zenodo via the nci-idc Zenodo community (https://zenodo.org/communities/nci-idc). Some of the highlights that make IDC unique are documented here: https://learn.canceridc.dev/frequently-asked-questions</r3d:remarks>
